{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15340010","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15340010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1534001001:1":{"text":"크러시랑 같이 여기서 골드 킹스네이크를 기다리고 있어요.","source_cn":"俺跟烈声在这里等金鳞蛇皇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x724B77887B96A081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1534001002:1":{"text":"사냥의 신이 변신시킨 물고기라고 하니, 분명 신의 힘이 남아있을 거예요.","source_cn":"既然这种鱼是被狩猎神变化的，身上肯定残留着狩猎神的神力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE565FE8D2F52EBAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1534001003:1":{"text":"언젠가는 마을을 습격할 테니 그 전에 반드시 없애야 해요!","source_cn":"它们迟早会袭击村落，俺们必须在那之前彻底消灭它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CEA599DEC4A82A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1534001004:1":{"text":"쓸데없는 소리 그만하고 얼른 와서 그물이나 던져!","source_cn":"能不能别废话了？快过来帮我一起放渔网！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E85C3EBC789AC99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:坚锤":{"text":"솔리드해머","source":"坚锤","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:烈声":{"text":"크러시","source":"烈声","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}